{
  "about": "A Video cue held on its last frame (hold at end, one pass of 3 s): the Duration cell and the Active Cues row show the same counting time, no bar, in light appearance with the sidebar open; the Time & Loops tab shows its line at the last frame.",
  "show": "Video",
  "appearance": "light",
  "displays": "V1:1920x1080",
